'' __FB_QUERY_SYMBOL__ OF A RESERVED NAME, RUN: asking about a name '#pragma reserve' took
'' is not a use of it (no TKO0770), and the answer is FB_SYMBCLASS_RESERVED, 16, as
'' fbc-modern gives. It was TKO0770, and with that out of the way 0.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 tests/codegen/src/query-symbol-reserved.bas -o tests/codegen/qsymres.exe
'' ENV: TKO_LIBPATH=toolchains/tiko-windows/lib/windows-x86_64
'' ENV: TKO_INCLUDE=toolchains/tiko-windows/inc
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-NOT: TKO0770
'' RUN: tests/codegen/qsymres.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  16 16
